---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';import Heading from '../components/Heading.astro';import {contact,path,linkedin} from '../lib/site';
---
<Base title="Contact"><Heading label="Start a conversation" title="Let’s build something useful." description="For educational collaborations, student entrepreneurship, speaking inquiries, or a conversation about the work."/><section class="section speaker-contact" id="speaking"><p class="eyebrow">For event organizers</p><h2>A perspective shaped by doing the work.</h2><p>I welcome conversations about student leadership, product development, financial education, and cross-cultural experience. Tell me about your audience, the format, and what you want people to leave thinking about.</p><div class="links"><a class="button" href={`mailto:${contact}?subject=Speaking%20inquiry`}>Invite me to speak ↗</a><a href={path('events/')}>Event & speaking record →</a><a href={path('resources/')}>Bio & portrait →</a></div></section><section class="section two-col"><div><img class="contact-portrait" src={path('images/varshith-ulisi.png')} alt="Varshith Sai Ulisi" width="800" height="800" loading="lazy"/><p class="eyebrow">Email</p><a class="contact-address" href={`mailto:${contact}`}>{contact}</a><p class="links"><a href={linkedin}>Connect on LinkedIn ↗</a></p><p class="caption">Please include a little context, what you have in mind, and any relevant timing.</p></div><div><h2>Good places to start.</h2><p>Free STEM opportunities and community partnerships.<br/>Student ventures and mentorship.<br/>Events, presentations, and thoughtful conversations.</p><p><a class="button" href={`mailto:${contact}?subject=Website%20inquiry`}>Write to me ↗</a></p></div></section><section class="section"><div class="two-col"><h2>Media & professional resources.</h2><div><p>Varshith Sai Ulisi is a student entrepreneur and community builder whose work connects education, technology, and opportunity. His projects include Uplift Academy Ohio, Mason Venture Studio, and MindMate Health. His experience spans English instruction in Guadalajara, free STEM programming in Ohio, and mentorship for student founders.</p><p><a class="button" href={path('resources/')}>Biographies, portrait & project summaries →</a></p><a href={path('biography.txt')} download>Download short & professional biographies ↓</a><p class="caption">For event organizers: please confirm current roles and event-specific details before publishing.</p></div></div></section></Base>
